{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日に引き続いてのブログ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個握！\n完売が出ていたようでたくさんの方が\n私のレーンに来てくれました。\nありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装はこんな感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかマーメイドっぽい\nイメージでやってたんだけど...\nどうかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪飾りも付けてたよー♪\nバッテンにして可愛くしました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近生駒さんがすごく好きなの。\nなんでだろう。\n生駒さんに会うといつもギューしてくれて\n嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんの男の子の格好が\n本当に好きでいつも見てて\nひゃぁぁぁぁあってなってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/04/10/2210051/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○最近の出来事◇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はアンダーライブのリハが中心で\nゆっくりする時間はないけど\n終わったら映画たくさん見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストロボエッジ、イントゥザウッズ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様はおすすめの映画ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}